#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:55
msgid "Create Inputs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:57
msgid ""
"Inputs are custom input fields which can be added to Layouts, Instance "
"Types, and other constructs in |morpheus|. The input can be consumed as "
"variables within templates and scripts. We'll create two Inputs in this "
"case, one to allow the user to enter a name for their folder on "
"provisioning and another which will be visible when editing the Instance "
"to allow the user to rename their folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:59
msgid ""
"In |morpheus| UI, navigate to |LibOptInp|. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. "
"Complete the following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:61
msgid ""
"**NAME:** DropBox Folder Name (The name for the Input object in "
"|morpheus|)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:62
msgid ""
"**FIELD NAME:** dbfoldername (The internal property which the input value"
" is assigned to)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:63
msgid ""
"**TYPE:** Text (The input type, in this case an open text field for the "
"user)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:64
msgid ""
"**SHOW ON EDIT:** Checked (When checked, this Option is visible when "
"editing an Instance)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:65
msgid ""
"**EDITABLE:** Checked (When checked, this Option is editable in addition "
"to being visible while editing the Instance)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/xaas_instance.rst:66
msgid ""
"**LABEL:** DropBox Folder Name (The label the user sees next to the input"
" field)"
